<div class="wpb_gmaps_widget wpb_content_element rounded"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="wpb_map_wraper"><iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1772.770602216213!2d-8.666226228000335!3d42.181466667668566!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x0!2zNDLCsDEwJzUzLjMiTiA4wrAzOSc1NS4xIlc!5e1!3m2!1ses!2ses!4v1601916761964!5m2!1ses!2ses" width="600" height="350" frameborder="0" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" aria-hidden="false" tabindex="0"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-2"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="vc_section"><div data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" data-vc-stretch-content="true" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row-no-padding"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="flex justify-end mb-4 border-t-4 wpc_section-full-title lg:w-full lg:mb-10 lg:border-t-8 border-primary-500" data-aos="maskDown" data-aos-delay="150" data-aos-duration="1200"><div class="w-full wpc_section-full-title__inner has-img--"><picture class="relative flex w-full h-full jarallax"><source media="(max-width: 639px)" srcset="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2020/06/20251016_Obras_Estadio_AbancaBalaidos-18-300x200.jpg"><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2020/06/20251016_Obras_Estadio_AbancaBalaidos-18-768x512.jpg"><source media="(min-width: 769px)" srcset="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2020/06/20251016_Obras_Estadio_AbancaBalaidos-18-1024x683.jpg"><img src="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2020/06/20251016_Obras_Estadio_AbancaBalaidos-18-1024x683.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="object-cover w-full h-full jarallax-img"></picture><div class="absolute bg-primary-500 lg:left-16 wpc_section-full-title__text-wrap"><h3 class="relative z-10 my-0 text-xl text-white uppercase lg:text-4xl font-display dark:text-dark-mode-900"> ESTADIO ABANCA BALAÍDOS</h3></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-2"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><hgroup class=" mb-4 wpc-title md:mb-6 title-skew"></p>
<h4><strong>Una breve introducción</strong></h4>
<p></hgroup>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Obra del <strong>reputado arquitecto Jenaro de la Fuente en su origen y de Pedro de la Puente en su versión remodelada</strong>, el Estadio de <strong>Abanca Balaídos</strong> es el hogar del <strong>Celta</strong> desde su inauguración en el año <strong>1928</strong>. Desde entonces ha sido el punto de encuentro del celtismo y el escenario de inolvidables momentos en la historia del <strong>Celta</strong>.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc-imgcustom " data-aos="maskRight" data-aos-duration="1000"><picture class="relative flex w-full vc-imgcustom__main-img has-img--"><source media="(max-width: 639px)" srcset="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2025/07/20250331_RCCELTAvsLASPALMAS_Diego_estadio_abanca_balaidos-aficion_157-1-1-scaled-e1753956356699-300x257.jpg"><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2025/07/20250331_RCCELTAvsLASPALMAS_Diego_estadio_abanca_balaidos-aficion_157-1-1-scaled-e1753956356699-768x659.jpg"><source media="(min-width: 769px)" srcset="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2025/07/20250331_RCCELTAvsLASPALMAS_Diego_estadio_abanca_balaidos-aficion_157-1-1-scaled-e1753956356699-768x659.jpg"><img src="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2025/07/20250331_RCCELTAvsLASPALMAS_Diego_estadio_abanca_balaidos-aficion_157-1-1-scaled-e1753956356699-768x659.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="object-cover w-full h-full"></picture></div><hr class="my-4 border-t-4 lg:my-8 border-primary-500">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ul class="grid grid-cols-2 col-gap-4">
<li><span class="text-xs uppercase md:text-sm font-titles">Inauguración</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75">1928</span></li>
<li><span class="text-xs uppercase md:text-sm font-titles">aforo</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75"><strong>24.870</strong> espectadores</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75"><strong>Sala Túnel VIP.</strong> Máximo de 25 personas</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75"> <strong>Sala Marcador Club 1923.</strong> Máximo de 75 personas</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75"> <strong>Sala Balcony Central.</strong> Máximo 150 personas</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75"> <strong>Sala Balcony Área.</strong> Máximo 75 personas</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75"> <strong>Sala Río Club.</strong> Máximo 160 personas</span> <a href="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2024/11/Docu_SalasHospitality_CAST.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Más información</a></li>
<li><span class="text-xs uppercase md:text-sm font-titles">Dimensiones</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75">105 x 70m</span></li>
<li><span class="text-xs uppercase md:text-sm font-titles">Teléfono</span> <a href="tel:+34 986 213 233"><span class="block text-sm opacity-75"><strong>+34 986 213 233</strong></span></a></li>
<li><span class="text-xs uppercase md:text-sm font-titles">Dirección</span> <span class="block text-sm opacity-75">Avda. de Balaídos s/n, 36210, Vigo</span></li>
</ul>

		</div>
	</div>
