<h4><strong>¿Qué es A Sede?</strong></h4>
<p></hgroup>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Ubicada en la céntrica <strong>calle de Príncipe</strong>, en el corazón de la ciudad de Vigo, la sede social del Celta <strong>alberga las oficinas del club y de la Fundación Celta</strong>, además de una<strong> residencia para la cantera,</strong> el <strong>Café A Sede</strong>, el <strong>Salón Regio, </strong>la <strong>tienda oficial</strong> del Celta, la <strong>Clínica Celta </strong>y el <strong>Restaurante Silabario</strong></p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-2"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1597405344385"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-10"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></p>
<div class="customVideo relative"><video class="w-full video object-cover group cursor-pointer" preload="none" style="aspect-ratio: 16/10;" poster="https://rccelta.es/app/uploads/2020/07/silabario-foto-ovidio-2-1.jpg" playsinline controls><source src="/app/themes/rccelta/dist/videos/video_a_sede.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><script>
            document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
                const videoContainers = document.querySelectorAll(".customVideo");
                videoContainers.forEach(container => {
                    const video = container.querySelector("video");
                    const playButton = container.querySelector(".video-play-button");
                    
                    function toggleVideo(e) {
                        // Prevent click from bubbling to container if clicking controls
                        if(e.target.closest(".video-play-button") || e.target === video) {
                            if(video.paused) {
                                video.play();
                                if(playButton) {
                                    playButton.style.display = "none";
                                }
                                video.controls = true;
                            } else {
                                video.pause();
                                if(playButton) {
                                    playButton.style.display = "flex";
                                }
                                video.controls = false;
                            }
                            e.stopPropagation();
                        }
                    }

                    // Add click handlers to both container and video
                    container.addEventListener("click", toggleVideo);
                    video.addEventListener("click", toggleVideo);
                    if(playButton) {
                        playButton.addEventListener("click", toggleVideo);
                    }

                    video.addEventListener("ended", function() {
                        if(playButton) {
                            playButton.style.display = "flex";
                        }
                        video.controls = false;
                    });
                });
            });
        </script>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1760627489477" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ul class="grid grid-cols-3 col-gap-4">
<li><span class="text-xs uppercase md:text-sm font-titles">Teléfono</span><br />
<strong><a href="tel:+34 986 213 233"><span class="block text-sm opacity-75">+34 986 110 900</span></a><br />
</strong></li>
<li><span class="text-xs uppercase md:text-sm font-titles">Dirección</span><br />
Calle Príncipe 44, 36202, Vigo</li>
</ul>

		</div>
